        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩndĩ Avilisiti nĩmokitie na Isilaeli: na andũ ma Isilaeli makũka makĩĩte Avilisiti, na mavalũkw’a me oae kĩĩmanĩ kya Ngilivoa. ",
